# Mobile env files (development build, not Expo Go):
#   pnpm dev        → .env.dev (+ optional .env.dev.local)
#   pnpm dev:prod   → .env.production
#   eas build       → env in eas.json
#
# First-time setup:
#   pnpm ios / pnpm android     — build & install a local dev client (simulator/emulator)
#   pnpm build:dev:ios/android  — EAS dev client for a physical device
#
# Copy for local overrides (git-ignored):
#   cp .env.dev.local.example .env.dev.local
#
# iOS simulator:     http://localhost:8787 (default in .env.dev)
# Android emulator:  same; `pnpm dev` tunnels port 8787 via adb automatically
# Physical device:   set LAN IP in `.env.dev.local`, then rebuild the dev client
# Production API:    https://haven-api.haven-app.workers.dev (in .env.production)
